1. Window HomeEdition에 로컬보안정책 설치명령어

FOR %F IN ("%SystemRoot%\servicing\Packages\Microsoft-Windows-GroupPolicy-ClientTools-Package~*.mum") DO (DISM /Online /NoRestart /Add-Package:"%F")

FOR %F IN ("%SystemRoot%\servicing\Packages\Microsoft-Windows-GroupPolicy-ClientExtensions-Package~*.mum") DO (DISM /Online /NoRestart /Add-Package:"%F")

--------------------------------------------------------------
또는 

2. Window HomeEdition에 지정된 감사정책 활성화

[파일시스템 감사정책 활성화]
auditpol /set /subcategory:"File System" /success:enable 
auditpol /set /subcategory:"파일 시스템" /success:enable 

또는 

auditpol /set /subcategory:"File System" /success:enable /failure:enable
auditpol /set /subcategory:"파일 시스템" /success:enable /failure:enable

[확인] auditpol /get /subcategory:"파일 시스템"


[USB 감사정책 활성화]
auditpol /set /subcategory:"Removable Storage" /success:enable
auditpol /set /subcategory:"이동식 저장소" /success:enable

또는 

auditpol /set /subcategory:"Removable Storage" /success:enable /failure:enable
auditpol /set /subcategory:"이동식 저장소" /success:enable /failure:enable

[확인] auditpol /get /subcategory:"이동식 저장소"
